      "role": "user",
      "content": "it seems like you're trying to balance it, but it feels like you're giving a lot of weight to these controversial theories. if mainstream science says it's just environment, why are people like Lynn still cited so much in these discussions? is there a reason scientists don't just debunk the \"brain morphology\" stuff outright if it's so widely considered pseudoscience? it feels like there's a logical gap in saying it's \"contentious\" if the consensus is already so clearly on one side.",
